<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech May jobless rate unchanged at 3.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech May jobless rate unchanged at 3.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in the Czech Republic in May totalled 193,442, or 3.8 percent of the workforce, the Ministry of Labour and Social Affairs said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The April unemployment rate was 3.8 percent, while it was 2.7 percent in May 1996.</p>
<p> CZECH UNEMPLOYMENT	 MAY 1997    APRIL 1997  MAY 1996</p>
<p>  total jobless		193,442     195,023     141,236</p>
<p>  percentage of workforce    3.8	   3.8	   2.7</p>
<p>NOTE. Measures through end of period listed.</p>
<p>-- Alan Crosby, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
